-- a raw TCP connect, whose check is against an address --
### connect 160.79.104.10:443 under --allow-net=0.0.0.0/0:443
$ deno run --no-prompt --allow-net=0.0.0.0/0:443 /home/pniroula/Projects/gvisor-t23/docs/snp/evidence/ticket23/spikes/E3/probe-connect.ts 160.79.104.10 443
OK connected to 160.79.104.10:443
EXIT=0

### connect 160.79.104.10:80 under --allow-net=0.0.0.0/0:443 (wrong port)
$ deno run --no-prompt --allow-net=0.0.0.0/0:443 /home/pniroula/Projects/gvisor-t23/docs/snp/evidence/ticket23/spikes/E3/probe-connect.ts 160.79.104.10 80
ERROR NotCapable: Requires net access to "160.79.104.10:80", run again with the --allow-net flag
EXIT=0

